gym.dtwin uses the following third-party data. Everything else (code, uz/ru texts,
starter programs, UI copy) is written by the gym.dtwin team.

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
free-exercise-db — https://github.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db
Used for: exercise list, English instructions, exercise photos (converted to webp,
served from gym.dtwin.uz). Files: src/catalogue/data/exercises.json,
src/catalogue/data/steps.en.json, public/ex/**
