exercises-dataset — https://github.com/hasaneyldrm/exercises-dataset
Commit: 7455efae41b330c265e7cd4b78dfa848e7ce5ebd
Used for: exercise TEXT only (names, body part, equipment, target and secondary
muscles, English instructions and their Russian translations), converted by
scripts/build-exdb.mjs. Files: src/catalogue/data/exdb.json,
src/catalogue/data/exdb.steps.en.json, src/catalogue/data/exdb.steps.ru.json
No images, GIFs, videos or media ids from that repository are downloaded,
stored, linked or recreated. Its media (images/, videos/) is (c) Gym visual and
is not covered by the license below; gym.dtwin does not use it. Entries that
duplicate free-exercise-db were dropped; uz/ru names are our own.
